WEBVTT

00:12:56.916 --> 00:13:01.476
This crazy time in our history
when we used to fill our cars with gas,

00:13:01.516 --> 00:13:03.556
heat our homes with gas.

00:13:03.596 --> 00:13:05.036
And they,

00:13:05.076 --> 00:13:07.996
well, they will barely believe me,

00:13:07.996 --> 00:13:11.276
because the world
will be such a different place.

00:13:11.876 --> 00:13:13.076
Thank you.

00:13:13.116 --> 00:13:17.036
(Applause and cheers)